     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Test all the options by substitution until you find the option that works.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6y + 10 = 12y\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6\\left( {\\frac{5}{3}} \\right) + 10 = 12\\left( {\\frac{5}{3}} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"10 + 10 = 20\"></span></p>\n<p>Since this is true, <span data-math=\"\\frac{5}{3}\"></span> is a solution.</p>"
    },
    {
